{"matched":75,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0979a01","n":"0979a","t":"云識摩呾喇多此云唯憑始迦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0979b01","n":"0979b","t":"攝於五乘中大乘所攝此等教"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0979c01","n":"0979c","t":"賢師等此等論師皆由邪知無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0980a01","n":"0980a","t":"一頌結歎歸能非明宗義由此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0980b01","n":"0980b","t":"故名安立言大乘者辨中邊論"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0980c01","n":"0980c","t":"意說識性二中有德即依唯識"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0981a01","n":"0981a","t":"妄法唯有識理但言三界非無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0981b01","n":"0981b","t":"說唯識所現又說諸法皆不離"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0981c01","n":"0981c","t":"名識麁動間斷了別轉故各隨"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0982a01","n":"0982a","t":"經部轉計及上座部言若爾滅"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0982b01","n":"0982b","t":"但說有心言寧知有所述曰為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0982c01","n":"0982c","t":"此內識生似外境現言謂唯有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0983a01","n":"0983a","t":"髮等此中都無少分實義由眼"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0983b01","n":"0983b","t":"色境五識之中隨一攝故如餘"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0983c01","n":"0983c","t":"有依他起故如幻事等若依勝"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0984a01","n":"0984a","t":"乘等以現量證境有返破憶持"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0984c01","n":"0984c","t":"謂既無外境許有此識生如同"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0985a01","n":"0985a","t":"四臥具然此外加刀杖及毒藥"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0985c01","n":"0985c","t":"如夢者顯夢所見為二定喻非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0986a01","n":"0986a","t":"第三難於中有三初別解如鬼"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0986b01","n":"0986b","t":"等不令得食鬼由惡業深極飢"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0986c01","n":"0986c","t":"述曰下第二段梵云筏有二義"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0987a01","n":"0987a","t":"述曰自下第三總結四義得成"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0987c01","n":"0987c","t":"怖此獄卒等量云彼受罪者應"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0988a01","n":"0988a","t":"迦攝更不能救見破非餘趣第"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0988b01","n":"0988b","t":"與彼天傍生同前他立因既能"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0988c01","n":"0988c","t":"者皆為強大故俱名勝此形顯"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0989a01","n":"0989a","t":"上來總是薩婆多救義述曰此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0989b01","n":"0989b","t":"以不許此果在業所熏內識之"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0989c01","n":"0989c","t":"因正云阿笈摩此翻為傳義當"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0990c01","n":"0990c","t":"種成唯識論第四卷中略有二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0991a01","n":"0991a","t":"利下二句說法無我勝利補特"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0991c01","n":"0991c","t":"即於三性但知初無餘二性有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0992a01","n":"0992a","t":"點了永恩生年五十四偏為上"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0992b01","n":"0992b","t":"世親年邁正理論後方始作也"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0992c01","n":"0992c","t":"於色中無風相故耳鼻舌三得"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0993a01","n":"0993a","t":"己相識故與五識作所緣緣如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0993b01","n":"0993b","t":"即總非古薩婆多自下別破述"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0993c01","n":"0993c","t":"有一實體唯意識境薩婆多師"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0994a01","n":"0994a","t":"推徵如餘論說述曰自下廣釋"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0994b01","n":"0994b","t":"無容有餘處故如麁聚色或於"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0994c01","n":"0994c","t":"觸名若異此者微有間隙中間"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0995b01","n":"0995b","t":"同品能立不成說諸聚色有方"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0995c01","n":"0995c","t":"二句明無分過初之二句文意"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0996b01","n":"0996b","t":"破無分不得相礙今破不礙令"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0998b01","n":"0998b","t":"非是一如說極微六方分異云"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0998c01","n":"0998c","t":"宗中此下第三總結不成顯歸"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0999a01","n":"0999a","t":"量果如證自證緣自證時自證"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0999b01","n":"0999b","t":"合有十一種出現量體廣如餘"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p0999c01","n":"0999c","t":"如薩婆多第三句中言及字者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1000b01","n":"1000b","t":"現境亦皆已滅即此現覺所有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1000c01","n":"1000c","t":"受無曾所受故現量亦無云何"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1001a01","n":"1001a","t":"境熏成種子今時相續意於此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1001b01","n":"1001b","t":"故或顯異於眠時夢故喻不言"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1001c01","n":"1001c","t":"所緣之境皆非實有許夢境攝"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1002a01","n":"1002a","t":"名世間也體非是漏立以淨名"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1002b01","n":"1002b","t":"決定或近善惡二種友如其能"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1002c01","n":"1002c","t":"中邪識決定或近善惡友及由"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1003a01","n":"1003a","t":"善惡心睡眠所壞故夢與覺感"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1003b01","n":"1003b","t":"他人之所害者世間殺羊魚等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1003c01","n":"1003c","t":"姓那者男聲即剪剃種男聲中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1004a01","n":"1004a","t":"濟拔作歸依處得壽命長迦延"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1005a01","n":"1005a","t":"無漏功德大勝佛言長者云何"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1005b01","n":"1005b","t":"人處也今罰罪人尚置其內中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1005c01","n":"1005c","t":"之王後欲征國師進諫以不吉"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1006b01","n":"1006b","t":"外境親能殺彼彼方說死述曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1006c01","n":"1006c","t":"自緣唯見分能緣他心故若爾"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1007a01","n":"1007a","t":"述學者當知述曰此論主解釋"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1007c01","n":"1007c","t":"諸後得智有二分耶有義俱無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1008a01","n":"1008a","t":"如前引教通無漏故今此二義"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1008b01","n":"1008b","t":"緣或說佛心亦變影像若許親"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1008c01","n":"1008c","t":"此執心名能遍計體是有法所"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1009a01","n":"1009a","t":"釋二識成決定外境非無失五"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1009b01","n":"1009b","t":"之能已略成立少分之義結所"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1834_p1009c01","n":"1009c","t":"數修習伏斷餘障至究竟位出"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T43n1834-唯識二十論述記","source":"CBETA T43n1834 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":93,"unit":"T43 頁欄"}